<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc said it has issued 80,000 European-style low exercise price warrants on Zurich Insurance.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> LONG CALL STRIKE    0.01 CHF	    ISSUE	  372 CHF</p>
<p> SHORT CALL STRIKE   400 CHF	     CAP LEVEL    400 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	    18.FEB.98	   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING		 NONE		  MAX YIELD    7.52 PCT</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE	427.30 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
